          the Exchange Act) adopted, modified or terminated a Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement or a non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement during the Company&#8217;s three months ended December 31, 2024, as such terms are defined under Item 408(a) of Regulation S-K.</div>

