              </td>

    <td style="width: 15.15%; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255);">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Class II &#8211; 2027</div>
              </td>

  </tr>

  <tr>

    <td style="width: 21.96%; vertical-align: middle;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Michael McCormick</div>
              </td>

